    <string name="vd_module_help">Module help</string>
    <string name="vd_module_help_body">The power-key, assistant, Circle to Search and accessibility options need LSPosed (or a compatible fork with the modern API 101+). In LSPosed, enable Atom as a module and tick its recommended scope: System Framework, System UI, Google, and your launcher. Then reboot.\n\nConnected means LSPosed sees the module; it does not prove every hook is active. Hooks start after the scoped processes restart, and a ROM that differs from what a hook expects simply leaves that option without effect (it is logged once in LSPosed\'s log). The list of processes running Atom\'s hooks shows what is really active.</string>
